sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Mixin as SecurityLifecycleMixin<br/>(applied to Sender/Receiver/Decrypt/<br/>EndSession/RsaKeyManager screens)
    participant Registry as _radioactiveBuffers<br/>(Uint8List registry)
    participant MainActivity as MainActivity<br/>cryptransfer/security, cryptransfer/file
    participant FS as Filesystem (temp dir)

    rect rgb(247,247,247)
    Note over Mixin,Registry: Registration (occurs throughout SD005 / SD009)
    Mixin->>Registry: registerBuffer(buffer)<br/>(plaintext, ciphertext, AES key, IV,<br/>encrypted AES key, decrypted bytes)
    end

    rect rgb(247,247,247)
    Note over Mixin,Registry: Eager unregister (sender, post-encryption - SD005 step 8)
    Mixin->>Mixin: plaintext.fillRange(0, len, 0)
    Mixin->>Registry: unregisterBuffer(plaintext)<br/>(removes by identity to avoid double-wipe)
    end

    rect rgb(247,247,247)
    Note over Mixin,FS: wipeAll() trigger points (any of)
    alt dispose() auto-wipe
        Mixin->>Mixin: dispose() -> wipeAll() before super.dispose()
    else SessionManager.wipeSession()
        Mixin->>Mixin: onBuffersWipe() callback (see SD014)
    else explicit pre/post-flight wipe
        Mixin->>Mixin: _wipeSensitiveData() (SenderScreen)
    else Save and Suicide
        Mixin->>Mixin: _saveAndWipe() (DecryptScreen, SD010)
    else watchdog/abort
        Mixin->>Mixin: transfer interruption handler
    end
    end

    rect rgb(247,247,247)
    Note over Mixin,Registry: wipeAll() body
    loop for each buffer in _radioactiveBuffers
        Mixin->>Registry: buffer.fillRange(0, buffer.length, 0)
    end
    Mixin->>Registry: _radioactiveBuffers.clear()
    Mixin->>Mixin: onBuffersWiped() (overridable hook)
    end

    rect rgb(247,247,247)
    Note over Mixin,FS: onBuffersWiped() - DecryptScreen override
    Mixin->>FS: _deleteTempFile()<br/>(deletes getTemporaryDirectory()/{fileName} from SD009)
    end

    rect rgb(247,247,247)
    Note over Mixin,MainActivity: Native pre-flight check (SD005 step 2)
    Mixin->>MainActivity: isFlagSecureActive() -> MethodChannel<br/>"cryptransfer/security"
    MainActivity-->>Mixin: (window.attributes.flags & FLAG_SECURE) != 0
    Note right of MainActivity: returns true on iOS/desktop/<br/>MissingPluginException/any error<br/>(fail-open for non-Android)
    end

    rect rgb(247,247,247)
    Note over Mixin,MainActivity: Native GC hint (kill-switch terminal step)
    Mixin->>MainActivity: requestNativeClear() -> MethodChannel "clearSession"
    MainActivity->>MainActivity: Thread { System.gc() }.start()<br/>(best-effort, swallows errors)
    end

    Note over Mixin,Registry: Known limitation - compute() isolate ciphertext<br/>(SD004/SD005/SD009) is copied back to the main isolate.<br/>The isolate's own heap copy cannot be fillRange-zeroed<br/>from the main isolate. Documented as an accepted<br/>inherent platform limitation (ZERO_REMANENCE_ANALYSIS.md).
